  "canteen_hatch": {
    "speaker": "The Hatch",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questReady",
            "quest": "dinners_out"
          }
        ],
        "node": "in"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "hours",
            "from": 18,
            "to": 6
          }
        ],
        "node": "shut"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questActive",
            "quest": "dinners_out"
          }
        ],
        "node": "wait"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "dinners_out",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "offer"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_hatch",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "first"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_hatch",
            "eq": 1
          }
        ],
        "node": "second"
      },
      {
        "node": "third"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "shut": {
        "lines": [
          "The shutter is down. A card on it: NO HOT FOOD AFTER THE BELL. Under it, smaller: or before it, some nights."
        ]
      },
      "offer": {
        "lines": [
          "Somebody behind the hatch is scraping a pan. \"You're not on the rota.\" A pause. \"Never mind. Three tins want taking out to the signalmen on Cinder Walk.\"",
          "\"They won't come in for them. Leave one at the foot of each dead signal, and don't wait for thanks.\""
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "I'll take them",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "dinners_out"
              },
              {
                "do": "give",
                "item": "signal_dinner",
                "qty": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait": {
        "lines": [
          "\"One at each dead signal on Cinder Walk. Three signals, three tins. They'll go cold, mind. They always do.\""
        ]
      },
      "in": {
        "lines": [
          "The shutter goes up a hand's width. \"All three? Good. They'll not say anything, so I will.\" A jar comes out across the counter, the lid wired down.",
          "\"Put some flesh on. There's a lot of walking in the Works.\""
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Thank you",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "dinners_out"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "first": {
        "lines": [
          "\"Five dinners at noon, same as ever. Five come back full.\"",
          "\"You don't stop making dinners because nobody comes, love. That's when you keep on.\""
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_hatch",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "second": {
        "lines": [
          "\"The night shift was to be relieved at six. It's on the rota. I don't write the rota, I only read it.\""
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_hatch",
            "value": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "third": {
        "lines": [
          "\"There's knocking in the pipe in the yard, some nights. Three and a rest and three. I don't answer it.\""
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "canteen_pipe": {
    "speaker": "Pipe Mouth",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questReady",
            "quest": "what_the_pipes_say"
          }
        ],
        "node": "in"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questActive",
            "quest": "what_the_pipes_say"
          }
        ],
        "node": "wait"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "what_the_pipes_say",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "offer"
      },
      {
        "node": "after"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "offer": {
        "lines": [
          "An iron pipe comes up out of the yard and ends in a flange, open. You put your ear to it.",
          "Knocking, a long way down: three, a rest, three. A plate on the flange: TO SLAG MERE."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Find where it comes up",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "what_the_pipes_say"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait": {
        "lines": [
          "Three, a rest, three. TO SLAG MERE. Listen at the pipe mouths there for where it is loudest."
        ]
      },
      "in": {
        "lines": [
          "The pipe is quiet. You keep your ear to it a while to be sure."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "It's stopped",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "what_the_pipes_say"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "after": {
        "lines": [
          "TO SLAG MERE. Quiet. Cold iron, and a long way down, water moving."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
