        "node": "offer_2"
      },
      {
        "node": "after"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "offer_1": {
        "lines": [
          "A locker bolted to the end of a siding. In it, the foreman's diary, the last three pages torn out.",
          "A note in the binding: pages in the wagons. read them in order."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Find the pages",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "the_foremans_diary"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait_1": {
        "lines": [
          "Three pages, in the slag wagons in the Sidings."
        ]
      },
      "in_1": {
        "lines": [
          "The diary, open at the torn edge."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Put the pages back",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "the_foremans_diary"
              },
              {
                "do": "take",
                "item": "diary_page",
                "qty": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "offer_2": {
        "lines": [
          "The last page: The clerk still goes down the Sidings with the wages every Friday. Pays nobody. Comes back. I would stop him if I could get down there.",
          "There is nothing after it but the cover."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Stop him",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "last_wagon"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait_2": {
        "lines": [
          "The pay clerk, at the end of the Sidings, with his satchel. It is not Friday, but he goes down anyway."
        ]
      },
      "in_2": {
        "lines": [
          "The diary, and room on the inside of the cover."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Write: paid off",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "last_wagon"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "after": {
        "lines": [
          "The foreman's diary, whole. Inside the cover, in your hand: paid off."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
