  "breen": {
    "speaker": "Mr Breen",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questReady",
            "quest": "breen_coal"
          }
        ],
        "node": "in"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questActive",
            "quest": "breen_coal"
          }
        ],
        "node": "wait"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "breen_coal",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "offer"
      },
      {
        "node": "after"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "offer": {
        "lines": [
          "Hut One. I'd ask you in, only there's no in to ask you to. The stove's been out since the spring.",
          "There's coal in the slag wagons in the Sidings. Three lumps would see me through. I'd go myself, but I can't leave the hut."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "I'll fetch it",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "breen_coal"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait": {
        "lines": [
          "The Sidings. The wagons with coal in. Three lumps."
        ]
      },
      "in": {
        "lines": [
          "That's the stuff. He builds it up in the stove like a man laying a table."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Here",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "breen_coal"
              },
              {
                "do": "take",
                "item": "coal",
                "qty": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not yet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "after": {
        "lines": [
          "Sit by it if you're passing. I don't mind company in the night. I'd not say no to it.",
          "Keep off Cinder Walk while it's dark. Not that there's anything on it. It's only what we do."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "pask": {
    "speaker": "Mr Pask",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
